{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to think about this more carefully. The key clues:\n- An award created in the 2000s\n- A book translated into 25+ languages that was a contender for this award\n- In the 2010s, the year Book A was published, Book B won the award\n- Book B was released the preceding year\n- Author of Book B was born in the city where Author of Book A grew up\n\nLet me think about awards created in the 2000s. The Man Asian Literary Prize was established in 2007. Let me also consider the International Dublin Literary Award (IMPAC Dublin Award) - but that was established earlier. Let me search for specific awards created in the 2000s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize winners 2010s\", \"literary prize established 2007 2008 2009 award created\", \"book translated 25 languages shortlisted award 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_d858078b2f8c458d9efc223a","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789476830,"id":"chatcmpl-973f4fc5-b7ee-932e-911d-384ee1b94d9c","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":9500,"completion_tokens":207,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":9707,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}